        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Design 3 — what lives where**\n\n- **Mimir (this dashboard / Explore → Mimir)** = metrics (`service_error_rate`, `service_cpu_percent`). Not logs.\n- **Tempo (Explore → Tempo)** = traces. Search, then filter `resource.agentops.design = d3`. Not logs.\n- **Logs** = OpenSearch Dashboards `http://localhost:5602` → Discover → index `agentops-d3-logs`. Grafana is the wrong place for D3 logs."
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "decimals": 2 }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "single" } },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "service_error_rate{service=\"checkout-service\"}", "legendFormat": "checkout error rate", "refId": "A" }
      ],
      "title": "Checkout error rate (Mimir)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "decimals": 1 }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "id": 2,
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "service_cpu_percent{service=\"checkout-service\"}", "legendFormat": "CPU", "refId": "A" },
